WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:04.540
About 80% of the world's population

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:10.300
is born with some kind of special trait,
a Quirk, in this superhuman society.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.170
"Quirk"

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.170
"Villains"              "Enemies"

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.930
To fight against villains using
their Quirks to commit crimes,

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.680
the profession of "hero" was created.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:27.310
"Ground Beta"

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:31.900
Those of us in U.A. High Class 1-A started
a rescue training exercise to prepare

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.360
for the provisional hero licensing exam.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.660
But suddenly, there was a mysterious collapse,

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.620
and we were trapped in the underground mall.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:49.420
As we tried to escape, we met up
with Yaoyorozu and an injured Iida.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:54.170
Overcoming each crisis as it
came along, we continued upward,

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:57.470
finally reaching the elevator lobby.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:03.100
But, it wasn't over yet.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:06.230
The real test was about to begin.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.820
Yes, about to begin...

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:23.700
<i>An ordinary moment dazzles</i>

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.250
<i>Enough to make you close your eyes</i>

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:30.920
<i>A ray of light is thrown</i>

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:34.550
<i>Into the dark unnoticed</i>

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:38.010
<i>Lost and confused in dreams</i>

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:41.470
<i>A tiny star falls down your cheeks</i>

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:45.230
<i>I give you a beat of my sound</i>

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:48.560
<i>Wiping away your fears</i>

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:54.820
<i>Put the new colors onto your past</i>

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:59.110
<i>Rainbow for the future</i>
<i>Hold up the palette</i>

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.830
<i>Show me your colors</i>

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:06.410
<i>The only thing I always hope</i>

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:09.580
<i>Through all the lousy nights</i>

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.460
<i>Right or wrong</i>
<i>Wrong or right</i>

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:13.380
<i>It doesn't matter to me</i>

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:17.260
<i>Just want to see you smile</i>

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.800
<i>Once in a lifetime</i>
<i>The sparkle of a moment</i>

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.890
<i>No, that prayer is too small</i>

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:27.430
<i>Make our belief intense</i>
<i>Jump over the fence</i>

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:30.980
<i>You can go anywhere</i>

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:35.690
<i>Cause we're the heroes</i>

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:45.040
"Make It! Do-or-Die Survival Training, Part 2"

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.000
Sunlight's shining in.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.000
We should be able to get out from here.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.840
We can get to the surface from here.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.550
Looking at the structure of the building,

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:00.760
the elevators only go up to floor B1.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:03.430
Then, why was there sunlight...?

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.010
Maybe...

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:10.980
...the part on the surface also collapsed,
letting the sunlight reach here.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.650
That would be good news for us.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:14.560
Yes.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:19.190
As long as we have Ochaco's Quirk,
we can definitely get to the surface.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.610
All right. I'll make everyone float and--

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:23.740
Wait a minute, Uraraka.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:28.580
Yaoyorozu, once you get to floor B1,
will you put a rope ladder down?

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.330
Huh? Sure.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.210
Midoriya, you're planning to stay, aren't you?

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.590
Stay? Why?

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.590
There might still be people from our class here,

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:42.010
and they might be injured, like Iida.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:45.800
I'll check to make sure
everyone's okay and send them here.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:50.020
You guys should prioritize getting Iida out.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.810
Very well.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:01.820
Yaoyorozu, report what's going on
in here to the teachers, too.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.660
Yes, of course!

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.990
Be careful, Midoriya.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.660
Deku, if it starts getting dangerous--

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.790
I know. I'll get out right away.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.590
All right, here we go.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:24.050
Todoroki, why did the emergency lights come on?

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:30.430
Either someone fixed the emergency power,
or someone sent Denki to it.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:32.100
Denki...

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.440
Kaminari, huh?

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:37.190
I'm sure someone was
telling Kaminari what to do.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:41.320
The ones who could think that
quickly are Midoriya, Yaoyorozu...

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:44.280
...and one more person.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.030
Bakugo!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.950
I found it! The training dummy
that needs rescuing!

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:50.870
Oh, good job!

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:54.830
Damn citizen making us do all this extra work!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.370
I'll beat you up later!

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:57.960
The training dummy?

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.420
But how will we get him out?

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.510
If we pull him out and make this collapse,

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.720
then we'll be crushed under the debris, too.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.090
What should we do, Bakugo?

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:08.220
Blow it up!

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:09.220
Huh?

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.560
Didn't you hear what I just said?

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:14.600
I thought I explained it pretty clearly!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:18.440
Look! It's unstable!
It could collapse any second now!

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:21.610
That's why we have to save him
before it collapses!

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.440
But you know...

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:27.570
Kaminari, if it wasn't a dummy
over there but a real human being

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.580
calling "Help me" out to you, what would you do?

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:32.580
Would you give up, saying it's impossible?

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.910
W-Well...

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:39.130
But that's not true right now...
it's a training exercise...

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:42.630
I don't think we should have
to do it if it's almost impossible...

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:44.840
You've got an idea, don't you, Bakugo?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:45.970
Of course!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.720
Then, let's do this.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.140
We came to U.A. to become heroes.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.510
Right, Kaminari?

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.180
Well, yeah, but...

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.930
There's no time!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:59.650
Let's hurry up and start, damn extras!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.400
At least tell us your plan!

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.620
We can get to the surface from there!

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.920
Uraraka, get Iida to
the nurse's office right away.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.510
Asui, please go with them
and report to Mr. Aizawa.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.510
I will return and make the rope ladder--

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:31.010
Are you the only ones who were able to escape?

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.010
Mr. Aizawa?!

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:41.400
Ready, extras?

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.940
--Yeah!
--All right, make sure you don't hit me!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:47.860
Die! Armor-Piercing Shot!

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.700
Go, Kirishima!

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.540
Got him!

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.510
--Get down!
--Huh?

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:12.550
Die to the max!

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.980
What's that sound? Collapsing?

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:24.690
No, someone on a lower floor
is destroying something.

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:26.230
Could it be...?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.490
This sound...

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.240
Bakugo?

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:36.870
We don't know when something else
will collapse. What's he thinking?

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.200
The sound of the blast came from below.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:42.540
Floor B6... the lowest floor, huh?

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.670
Of course it'd be the most unstable place.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:50.340
Bakugo was the one
who restored the emergency power...

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.840
And this explosion on top of that...

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:57.850
Don't tell me he's continuing
the rescue training under these conditions...

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.060
Todoroki!

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:07.860
What should we do? What should we do?

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.490
It's because of what
you did in a place like this!

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:11.490
Shut up!

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:14.360
Stop whining! Let's get to the surface--

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:21.620
Hey, wait, at this rate, we'll drown to death!

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:24.210
What should we do, Bakugo?!

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:29.460
--Kiss!
--You're not going to go save them...?

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.050
What do you mean, Mr. Aizawa?!

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.970
Could the collapse of the underground mall be...

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:37.430
An accident within expectations.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:41.520
Just so you know,
if you can't get past a crisis like this,

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.730
you're not likely to pass the
provisional licensing exam, either.

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:46.060
But Iida's injured,

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:49.360
and there might be others
down there who can't move...

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:54.320
In that case, they won't be heroes
anymore--they'll need rescuing.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.780
Who will save them?

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.370
I'll get the rope ladder ready!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.490
I'll go, too!

00:08:58.490 --> 00:08:59.830
Ribbit!

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:04.330
Don't you think you're going a little overboard?

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:07.380
I've made arrangements to deal
with the worst if it happens.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.630
Tokoyami, break the floor with Dark Shadow.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:16.680
But, I won't be able
to control him in this darkness--

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.600
I'll hold him back with my flames.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.890
Very well.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.180
Dark Shadow!

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:27.600
I-I can't anymore...

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:31.980
Wh-What was that?!

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:36.820
This way!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:37.990
Climb up!

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:39.200
Todoroki!

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.870
Who asked for <i>your</i> help?!

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:43.870
What are you saying in a situation like this?

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:48.080
Let's take his help!
Let's sponge off him as much as we can!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.000
Come on, hurry up!

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.630
Bakugo, let's go!

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:52.460
Stop pulling me!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.130
Come <i>on</i>!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:59.260
We're saved...

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:02.510
Thanks, Todoroki, Tokoyami.

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.310
I'm glad you're safe.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:07.730
There's no time to relax.

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.440
The water underground isn't slowing down.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.360
I'll freeze it to hold it back.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.570
In the meantime, you guys get out of here.

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:16.740
Todoroki, I'll stay with you--

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:20.570
With your Quirks, you won't be
able to deal with this situation,

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.580
and if you're too close,
you'll just get caught up in the ice.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:27.210
If you don't want to be a burden,
then hurry up and go.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:29.290
It's as Todoroki says.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.210
It's a race against time.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.090
Let's leave this place.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:33.710
R-Right.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.670
Acting all cool.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:37.090
We'll wait for you at the top!

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:38.840
Yeah.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.810
In this sprawling space,
how much can I freeze...?

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:56.070
I'll make sure I stall at least long enough
for those guys to get out of here.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:11.040
What happened? The temperature's dropped...

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:14.170
Is Todoroki using his ice?

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.340
In order to hold back the collapse?

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:19.130
Anyway, I need to get to the bottom, fast.

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:22.340
Even if I have to force my way down...!

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.560
Midoriya?!

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:32.810
Kirishima, Kaminari, Tokoyami!

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.940
Oh, good. You guys are okay!

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.900
Yeah, and so are you.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.940
Guys, if you go straight this way,

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.450
inside the elevator with its door open,
there's a rope ladder.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.870
Use that to go to the surface.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:45.120
Seriously?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.120
We're saved, Kirishima!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.120
Yeah.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:52.460
Tokoyami, Todoroki's still down there, isn't he?

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:56.290
He's holding back the
water underground with his ice.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.760
With his ice...?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.510
Also...

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.680
Just a little more. You can do it.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.430
There's no rope ladder!

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:11.600
What's going on?

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.890
Kirishima?

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.520
I heard Kaminari's voice, too.

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.400
Kirishima! Kaminari!

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.780
That voice! Uraraka?

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:25.570
Yeah! We're letting down the
rope ladder now, so hang on a little longer!

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:26.780
Okay!

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:29.870
Yaoyorozu's the one making
the rope ladder, right?

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:33.080
I'm sure you're tired, so sorry,
but we're counting on you!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:38.540
O-Of course... Plus Ultra...

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:46.800
It looks like I was able to stop
the water from rising somehow...

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.930
More importantly,
why are you still here, Bakugo?

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.230
I don't want to owe you anything.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:54.270
I don't care about that. Let's get out of here.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:56.230
It's too late.

00:12:56.230 --> 00:13:00.020
There's no use running now.

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:03.820
No matter how amazing Todoroki's ice is,

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:08.740
I can't imagine he'd be able
to freeze such a large space.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:14.540
He's probably only frozen the
top layer of water on the surface,

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:19.000
but that's likely getting pressure put on it
from the water streaming in below.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:24.340
If that happens, the pressurized water'll
come out from the cracks in the walls

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:28.590
and fly out like water jets with debris inside.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:32.850
In the worst-case scenario,
the whole underground mall will collapse.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:35.480
Of course, I also predicted
that that would happen.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.020
Shut up!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.270
But you stayed behind.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:44.070
Kacchan stayed behind to save Todoroki.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:49.950
And I'm sure Kacchan's thought
of a way to get out.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:52.290
What would Kacchan do...?

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:56.040
How would Kacchan save Todoroki...?

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:59.460
You've already thought
of a way to get out, right?

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:02.670
Listen carefully, Half-and-Half Bastard.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:06.260
I'm gonna make a hole
in the ice with an explosion

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:09.010
and make a geyser.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.550
Water will gush out,

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:16.480
and Todoroki can make a place
for them to stand with ice as they rise up.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:22.110
I'll keep blasting upward
to make holes in the ceilings,

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:25.530
and we can get to the top all at once.

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.650
I understand your plan.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.360
But, can you aim your blast accurately enough

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:33.240
to make a hole that'll make a water spout?

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.660
I can do it!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:39.370
No, even if it's Kacchan,
the success rate for that is pretty low.

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:45.170
But with my Shoot Style,
I can make a big enough hole in the ice.

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:48.590
With my Costume Gamma
that Hatsume made for me...

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:53.300
If I raise the One For All percentage
as high as I can with my increased stamina...

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.390
Kacchan! Todoroki!

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:58.600
Midoriya!

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.440
What are you doing here, damn nerd?!

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.360
I'll open the hole in the ice.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.150
You little--

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:06.900
Todoroki, please get ready to make the ice.

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:07.990
Got it.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:10.070
Kacchan, you get ready to blast the ceiling.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.740
Don't tell me what to do!

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.580
There's no time. Here I go!

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:23.000
One For All... Full Cowling 5%!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:27.840
Smash...!

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.430
Die...!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.480
The next one's coming!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.190
Damn it!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.740
Midoriya!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.410
--Kaminari!
--Kaminari!

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:02.830
Tokoyami!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.630
This way, Kaminari!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.050
I-I'm saved...

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:09.800
Let's hurry.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.050
R-Right.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.180
Nice, Tsu!

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.550
Ribbit, ribbit.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:20.770
Wh-Where am I...?

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:24.440
Oh, good. You've woken up, Iida.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:27.650
Yaoyorozu, what happened to me...?

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:31.320
The underground mall
collapsed during training...

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:32.990
I see...

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.200
Back then...

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:41.290
You carried me here after I was injured, huh?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.410
Thanks.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:45.210
<i>I'm</i> the one who should be thanking <i>you</i>.

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.790
Thank you for saving me.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.710
It was nothing...

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.010
Where's everyone else?

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.340
Hey!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:59.100
Oh, Kirishima, Kaminari, Tokoyami!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.930
And Uraraka and Asui, too!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.060
Call me "Tsu."

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.400
And Tsu, too. I'm glad you're all okay.

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:12.400
Where's Midoriya, Bakugo, and Todoroki?

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:17.490
Actually, water suddenly
rushed into the bottom floor,

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:20.830
so Todoroki said he would give us
time to escape with his ice.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.160
Bakugo also stayed behind with him.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:27.460
When Midoriya heard that,
he started running, saying he'd go save them.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:28.960
What?

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.670
Then, the three of them are still in there...?

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.220
I'm sure they're fine!

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:37.470
If Deku said he was going to save them,

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:40.600
I think it's because
he knew that he <i>could</i> save them.

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:45.940
Besides, it'll take more than that
to get the best of Bakugo and Todoroki!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:49.730
So of course all three of them are fine!

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.070
You're right.

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:55.780
All right, let's make
a rescue team with who's here.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:59.200
Can I count on you? Kirishima, Uraraka, Tsu?

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.320
--Yes!
--Yeah!
--Ribbit!

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.830
We'll definitely save them!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:05.080
If I know those guys, they're
definitely heading toward the surface!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.250
Let's start searching from floor B2.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:24.430
Midoriya.

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:31.690
Midoriya... Wake up, Midoriya!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:39.200
T-Todoroki...

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.320
Are you hurt?

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:46.200
I'm feeling bruised from getting
bumped around, but I can move.

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.040
What floor is this?

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.460
We fell after destroying
the ceiling three times,

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:54.300
so we're probably on floor B3.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:57.210
I see. We made it pretty far.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.180
We should be able to get to the surface

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:00.890
before the water rises to this point, then.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:04.600
It's thanks to you, Todoroki. And Kacchan--

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:07.020
Kacchan?!

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:08.810
Where's Kacchan?

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:12.610
Kacchan!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.730
Bakugo!

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:22.620
Kacchan!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:26.160
Kacchan, wake up! Kacchan!

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:30.920
Stop yelling in my ear! It's annoying.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.500
Kacchan...

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:35.380
Bakugo, grab onto me and Midoriya.

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.210
We're getting out of here.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:40.680
An injury like this is nothing.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:41.840
Don't push yourself.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.260
I don't need your help.

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:48.640
Kacchan, there's no time. C'mon, grab on.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:49.770
No way.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.770
Kacchan!

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:55.020
I'm gonna force myself
to do it even if it kills me!

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:58.150
A guy who needs help for something like this,

00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:01.320
will never become the number one hero--

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:03.240
You're unsteady on your feet.

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:06.200
My feet just won't do what I'm telling them to!

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.200
Kacchan, hang onto me.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.370
Let go, Deku!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.410
No!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.750
Let go!

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.750
I want to save you, too!

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:18.300
You're the one who restored
the emergency power, right?

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.380
To make it easier for everyone else to get out.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:25.800
No! It was just to find
that damn citizen faster!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.560
They why did you stay until the end?

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:31.480
You wanted to save Todoroki, didn't you?

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.560
I don't want to owe him anything!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.270
I was saved by you, too.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:37.730
Yeah, me too.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:41.690
So let us do this, even if it's just for now.

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.030
Please.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.780
I refuse.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:48.530
Kacchan...

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.750
Be my cane!

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:57.790
Huh?

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:01.670
I said, be my cane so I can
walk out of here myself!

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:05.340
Oh, right, okay... I'll be your cane.

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:06.720
Canes don't talk!

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.430
Sorry! I won't talk anymore!

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.600
You're still talking!

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:16.100
I don't know what you're saying, damn nerd!

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.320
We're almost there, you two. You can do it.

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:21.530
Y-Yeah.

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:23.360
I told you not to talk!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:24.900
There they are!

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:27.990
Hey!

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.370
Until the provisional licensing exam,

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:35.290
I will build many walls in front of you all...

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:36.710
Overcome them...

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:39.000
And go beyond them...

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:41.050
Go beyond...

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:43.130
Plus Ultra.
